use on Meta Quest headsets.\n\nEnjoy all the features you know from immerGallery: view **VR180, VR360 (2D and 3D), panoramas, and standard 2D and 3D content**. \n\nCreate **immersive slideshows** with background audio and voice-over. **Automatic format detection for images and videos** ensures a smooth, hassle-free experience without manual setup.\n\nimmerGallery Business adds powerful tools tailored to business needs. Use **Kiosk Mode** to restrict access to a specific folder and lock settings behind an admin PIN. Add your **company logo, customize interface colors**, and **show only the menu buttons** your audience needs.\n\nManage multiple headsets with **Config Sync.** Upload your configuration once, including all settings and preferences, and apply it to other devices using a simple code. **Sync image and video content via shared SMB folders or WWW Sync** using online ZIP gallery links.\n\nSpeed up performance with **Pre-Caching**, which prepares thumbnails in advance. Use up to **eight favorites lists** to tailor content for different customer groups.\n\nWorks seamlessly with **Meta for Work** and **Meta Horizon Managed Services**, making deployment and management across your organization even easier.\n\nA subscription is required to unlock all features.\n\nQuestions? support@immerVR.com", "short_description": "Welcome to immerGallery Business, the VR image, slideshow and video viewer designed for business use on Meta Quest headsets.\n\nEnjoy all the features you know from immerGallery: view VR180, VR360 (2D and 3D), panoramas, and standard 2D and 3D content. \n\nimmerGallery Business adds powerful tools:\n\u2022 Kiosk Mode to limit access\n\u2022 Add your company logo, customize colors, and simplify menus\n\u2022 Sync settings across headsets\n\u2022 Easy content sync via SMB or WWW"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://imrvr.com/privacy_policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "immerVR GmbH", "su